## Project Origins and Authors

The development of **pyLOCO** began in 2021 as part of a PhD research project at **Deutsches Elektronen-Synchrotron (DESY)**, Hamburg, Germany. The initial implementation was developed and tested through simulation studies for FCC-ee and PETRA IV.

Following the PhD research, development continued to extend the framework towards operational applications. The framework was subsequently validated through experimental studies and released under the name **pyLOCO**.

